@startuml turn_planning
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml
title Recipient-local queue eligibility primitives
component "Known recipient board + own mines / siege" as KNOWN <<app>>
component "Ordered own action prefix" as PREFIX <<app>>
component "Known append constraints\nactor / shape / timing / vacancy" as APPEND <<app>>
component "Heads-first B dependency order\nstructural C rewrite" as ORDER <<app>>
component "Own-unit dependency fold\ninsertion and resulting contexts" as FOLD <<app>>
component "Live / native-drop eligibility\nindependent insertion diagnostic" as RESULT <<app>>
component "Authoritative queue edits\nshape / dependency checks + gas debit/refund" as EDIT <<app>>
KNOWN --> APPEND
PREFIX --> APPEND
PREFIX --> ORDER
ORDER --> FOLD
KNOWN --> FOLD : own units only
FOLD --> RESULT
RESULT --> EDIT : validate before publishing edits
note bottom of RESULT
  Do not query hidden simulator occupancy or enemy queues.
  Local transfer tags do not replace economic lineage IDs.
  Recipient helpers do not read simulator state.
  Authoritative edits consume trusted full snapshots.
  Neither boundary resolves turns or authenticates observations.
end note
@enduml
